        "answer": {
          "short": "$-1$",
          "worked": "Halfway is half of $6$ units from each endpoint.\n$$\\begin{align*}6\\div2&=3\\\\-4+3&=-1\\end{align*}$$\n$-1$ is $3$ units right of $-4$ and $3$ units left of $2$.",
